* The derivative of a function holomorphic on its whole domain is a function on that domain.

s1::holdm |- ( ( F e. ( D -cn-> CC ) /\ D C_ dom ( CC _D F ) ) -> dom ( CC _D F ) = D )
s2::dvfcn |- ( CC _D F ) : dom ( CC _D F ) --> CC
s3:s2:a1i |- ( ( F e. ( D -cn-> CC ) /\ D C_ dom ( CC _D F ) ) -> ( CC _D F ) : dom ( CC _D F ) --> CC )
